2026-07-27T09:46:29.5080515Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:46:29.5080840Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:46:29.5081331Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:46:29.5082050Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:46:29.5082896Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
